## ScreenTrack Android Configuration
## Copy this file to local.properties or enter these in Android Studio
## Once you create a Supabase project at https://supabase.com, paste your project URL and anon public key below:

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
